Package: sdlrm
Type: Package
Title: Modified Skew Discrete Laplace Regression for Integer-Valued and
        Paired Discrete Data
Version: 0.1.2
Authors@R: person("Rodrigo", "Medeiros",
    email = "rodrigo.matheus@ufrn.br",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Implementation of the modified skew discrete Laplace (SDL) regression model.
    The package provides a set of functions for a complete analysis of integer-valued data, 
    where the dependent variable is assumed to follow a modified SDL distribution. This regression
    model is useful for the analysis of integer-valued data and experimental studies in which
    paired discrete observations are collected.
